<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_IV__cl_16__subsec_3__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "memberitahu Ketua Pengarah secara bertulis mengenai tarikh pemberhentian dalam masa tiga puluh hari dari tarikh pemberhentian itu; dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_IV__cl_16__subsec_3__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_IV__cl_16__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
