<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_IV__cl_16__subsec_5__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_IV__cl_16__subsec_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
