<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_IV__cl_16__subsec_5__para_b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
