<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Cukai Perkhidmatan 2018."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
