<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_VI__cl_35__subsec_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "keseluruhan atau mana-mana bahagian cukai perkhidmatan yang kena dibayar kepada orang itu telah dihapus kira dalam akaunnya sebagai hutang lapuk; dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_VI__cl_35__subsec_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_VI__cl_35__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_VI__cl_35__subsec_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "b" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_VI__cl_35__subsec_1__para_b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_VI__cl_35__subsec_1__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "Ketua Pengarah berpuas hati bahawa segala usaha yang munasabah telah dibuat oleh orang itu untuk mendapatkan balik cukai perkhidmatan itu."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_VI__cl_35__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_VI__cl_35__subsec_2__para_a> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_VI__cl_35__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_VI__cl_35__subsec_2__para_b> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
