<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_V__cl_26__subsec_6__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "melanggar subseksyen (1), (2) atau (3); atau"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_V__cl_26__subsec_6__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_V__cl_26__subsec_6> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
