<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_V__cl_27__subsec_4__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "Ketua Pengarah telah membuat suatu taksiran cukai perkhidmatan di bawah subseksyen (1) berkenaan dengan perenggan (1)(a) atau (b);"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_V__cl_27__subsec_4__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_V__cl_27__subsec_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
