<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_V__cl_28__subsec_3__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_V__cl_28__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
