<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_XII__cl_74__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_XII__cl_74__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_XII__cl_74__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Seseorang pekerja mana-mana orang boleh membuat urusan secara am dengan mana-mana pegawai cukai perkhidmatan yang hak bagi pihak orang itu."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
