<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Pegawai kanan cukai perkhidmatan yang diberi kuasa di bawah subseksyen (1) boleh, jika perlu untuk berbuat demikian—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "a" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_2__para_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "memecah buka mana-mana pintu luar atau pintu dalam tempat, premis atau pengangkut itu dan memasuki tiap-tiap bahagiannya, jika perlu dengan kekerasan;"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_2__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_2__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "b" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_2__para_b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_2__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "mengalihkan dengan kekerasan apa-apa halangan kepada kemasukan untuk menggeledah atau menyita sebagaimana yang dia diberi kuasa untuk melakukannya; dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_2__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@/~part_X__cl_60__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/11/msa@> .
